# Apocalypse Nigh (battlefield.apocalypse_nigh, Empyreal Paradox): the registrant's requirements (Quest[3][89]Prog
# 3). Each char triggers TR_Entrance and gets a lone release (052), no menu: main (accepted, Prog 1: below the var);
# bob (accepted, Prog 5: above it, the quest's zone-in answers only Prog 4); cat (quest available, Prog 3); dan
# (quest completed, Prog 3).
lists EmpyrealParadox/TR_Entrance/onTrigger
char zone=EmpyrealParadox pos=541.5,-1.2,-597.7 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=EmpyrealParadox pos=541.5,-1.2,-597.7 job=WAR lvl=75
char cat zone=EmpyrealParadox pos=541.5,-1.2,-597.7 job=WAR lvl=75
char dan zone=EmpyrealParadox pos=541.5,-1.2,-597.7 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.ApocalypseNigh accepted
charvar Quest[3][89]Prog 1
bob: quest Jeuno.ApocalypseNigh accepted
bob: charvar Quest[3][89]Prog 5
cat: charvar Quest[3][89]Prog 3
dan: quest Jeuno.ApocalypseNigh completed
dan: charvar Quest[3][89]Prog 3
login
bob: login
cat: login
dan: login
trigger TR_Entrance
bob: trigger TR_Entrance
cat: trigger TR_Entrance
dan: trigger TR_Entrance
